y incurred and due credit for payments or proceeds of resale. Definitional Cross References: “Buyer”. Section 2–103. “Contract”. Section 1–201. “Seller”. Section 2–103. § 2–709. Action for the Price (1) When the buyer fails to pay the price as it becomes due the seller may recover, together with any incidental damages under the next sec- tion, the price § 2–709ARTICLE 2. SALES"